<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Reduce downtime" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Reduce downtime</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Thanks to high availability on each level (controller, network and interface modules) single points of failure are eliminated.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Easy to maintain" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Easy to maintain</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Hot swapping allows to replace automation components during operation and with Configuration-in-RUN (CiR) the extension is also possible. </p><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://players.brightcove.net/1813624294001/f83fb7f6-75c0-411c-872c-ab6095a19211_default/index.html?videoId=6391753509112">Learn more about CiR &gt;</a></p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Easy to integrate" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Easy to integrate</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>No additional software or license is needed. Same engineering software, TIA Portal, but no programming for synchronization and management of redundancy.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='5tbiB17mCZhUGfY1Yc5poW' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_4' data-ste-section-id='5tbiB17mCZhUGfY1Yc5poW'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-5tbiB17mCZhUGfY1Yc5poW" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="5tbiB17mCZhUGfY1Yc5poW" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-5tbiB17mCZhUGfY1Yc5poW"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Scalable switchover time" id="G_Scalable%20switchover%20time-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Scalable%20switchover%20time-0-title" aria-describedby="G_Scalable%20switchover%20time-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Scalable%20switchover%20time-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Scalable switchover time</h3><div id="G_Scalable%20switchover%20time-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Redundant and high-availability CPU pairs are connected either with PROFINET or with synchronization modules and fiber-optic cable to allow a fail-over time of 300 ms or 50 ms.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Hot standby" id="G_Hot%20standby-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Hot%20standby-1-title" aria-describedby="G_Hot%20standby-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Hot%20standby-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Hot standby</h3><div id="G_Hot%20standby-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>The backup CPU is automatically fed the same program by the system and synchronously monitors the primary CPU in operation. Up-to-date data is available in the primary and backup CPUs at all times so that the backup can take over.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Engineering in TIA Portal" id="G_Engineering%20in%20TIA%20Portal-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Engineering%20in%20TIA%20Portal-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Engineering%20in%20TIA%20Portal-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Engineering%20in%20TIA%20Portal-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Engineering in TIA Portal</h3><div id="G_Engineering%20in%20TIA%20Portal-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Engineering and visualization take place in TIA Portal, including simulation of the CPU using PLCSIM Advanced. Program a redundant CPU, with or without safety-related functions, the same way as other SIMATIC controllers.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="CardsContainer" props-url="/props/5tbiB17mCZhUGfY1Yc5poW-en-US.json" page-id="2e6lQgPw7L5rVrk0IaC0yG" container="comp-5tbiB17mCZhUGf